    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you get overrun or can you top the leader board? Auto-battler style clicker with fun characters vying for control of the map. Build and upgrade your army to take on more challenging levels! Place tesla coils to increase energy production and defend your base! Select and send your units anywhere you want for a strategic advantage or let them hunt down enemies on their own.</p>",
